# === Credentials (never part of a build context) ===
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
deploy/sandbox/client-certs/
# Operator-edited env templates. docker-compose loads them from the HOST via
# `env_file:` and the app never reads configs/.env.* at runtime, so nothing in
# the image needs them — and a filled-in .env.production must not end up in a
# layer that gets pushed to a registry.
configs/.env*

